      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "1. design a system to add reviews\n2. reward customer who added *best* reviews\n    within the last month.\n3. item page shows list of all the reviews (paginated,\n    sorted)\n4. users can upvote/downvote the reviews.\n5. upvotes/downvotes are the only signal for \n    computing the best customer reviews.\n6. unique items on the platfom - 100M\n   500M overall users\n   20% Daily active\n   out of 20% -> 10% leave a review\n   10M user leaving review a day\n7. come up with X users for rewarding\n\n\n      \n    ",
      "roughness": 1,
      "seed": 2145443473,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "text": "1. design a system to add reviews\n2. reward customer who added *best* reviews\n    within the last month.\n3. item page shows list of all the reviews (paginated,\n    sorted)\n4. users can upvote/downvote the reviews.\n5. upvotes/downvotes are the only signal for \n    computing the best customer reviews.\n6. unique items on the platfom - 100M\n   500M overall users\n   20% Daily active\n   out of 20% -> 10% leave a review\n   10M user leaving review a day\n7. come up with X users for rewarding\n\n\n      \n    ",
