    {
      "groupIds": [],
      "angle": 0,
      "backgroundColor": "#00000001",
      "baseline": 1964,
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "height": 1968,
      "id": "R59I8gITvnvX2IS-_dvdh",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n1. system should support adding reviews on items\n2. system should support showing fetching reviews for an item\n    paginated, sorted. It should also give avg rating when fetching\n    reviews.\n3. system should support upvoting/downvoting a review (on an item)\n4. system should generate a ranked list of users who should be \n    rewarded for leaving reviews\n\n\nNon Functional Requirements\n1. Availability >> Consistency. Should be eventually consistent \n    within 10s.\n2. Fault tolerant. \n \n-----------\n\n100 x 10^6 unique items\n10 x 10^6 reviews a day ~ 100 review/s -> write\n100 M read a day ~ 1000/s reads\n\n------------\n\nEntities\n\nUser\n\nItem\n- id \n\nItemReview\n- item_id\n- id\n- user_id\n- body\n- rating: int []\n- metadata [created_at/]\n\nItemReviewVote\n- review_id\n- user_id\n- value: +-1 -> upvote/downvote\n- metadata [created_at/modified_at]\n\nUserReviewMetadata\n- user_id\n- review_score\n\n\n--------------\nAPIs\n\n\nPOST /item/{id}/review\n-> ItemReview\n<- ItemReview\n\nPUT /item/{id}/review/{id}\n-> ItemReview\n\nGET /item/{id}/review\n<- {\n    metadata: {\n        avg_rating: <computed_value>\n        //\n    }\n    items: []ItemReview\n}\n\n\nPOST /item/{id}/review/{id}/vote\n-> ItemReviewVote\n<- ItemReviewVote\n\nGET /topreviewer/?month=?\n<- {\n    item: []UserReviewMetadata\n}\n\n\n\n",
      "roughness": 1,
      "seed": 1315823729,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n1. system should support adding reviews on items\n2. system should support showing fetching reviews for an item\n    paginated, sorted. It should also give avg rating when fetching\n    reviews.\n3. system should support upvoting/downvoting a review (on an item)\n4. system should generate a ranked list of users who should be \n    rewarded for leaving reviews\n\n\nNon Functional Requirements\n1. Availability >> Consistency. Should be eventually consistent \n    within 10s.\n2. Fault tolerant. \n \n-----------\n\n100 x 10^6 unique items\n10 x 10^6 reviews a day ~ 100 review/s -> write\n100 M read a day ~ 1000/s reads\n\n------------\n\nEntities\n\nUser\n\nItem\n- id \n\nItemReview\n- item_id\n- id\n- user_id\n- body\n- rating: int []\n- metadata [created_at/]\n\nItemReviewVote\n- review_id\n- user_id\n- value: +-1 -> upvote/downvote\n- metadata [created_at/modified_at]\n\nUserReviewMetadata\n- user_id\n- review_score\n\n\n--------------\nAPIs\n\n\nPOST /item/{id}/review\n-> ItemReview\n<- ItemReview\n\nPUT /item/{id}/review/{id}\n-> ItemReview\n\nGET /item/{id}/review\n<- {\n    metadata: {\n        avg_rating: <computed_value>\n        //\n    }\n    items: []ItemReview\n}\n\n\nPOST /item/{id}/review/{id}/vote\n-> ItemReviewVote\n<- ItemReviewVote\n\nGET /topreviewer/?month=?\n<- {\n    item: []UserReviewMetadata\n}\n\n\n\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "type": "text",
      "updated": 1770685234787,
      "version": 1574,
      "versionNonce": 3365663,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "width": 785.15625,
      "x": -1286.1795654296884,
